    "detailed_description": "The Lost City was once a thriving underground metropolis until it was cursed by the gods and abandoned. Now only a fool would dare pass it's gates (that's you). Descend into an abandoned underground city to battle orcs, solve puzzles, collect loot, and return to the surface to craft weapons, armor, and potions.<br><strong><u><br>Features:</u></strong><br>\u2022 Hand-crafted rooms are procedurally re-arranged every time you enter the dungeon so you'll never play the same layout twice<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/0f60a4992bd23c575a1e3c2fdcb4ce88.poster.avif?t=1651607437\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/0f60a4992bd23c575a1e3c2fdcb4ce88.webp?t=1651607437\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><br>\u2022 Fluid, 3rd-Person Melee and Ranged combat<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/f809a0bee695688f2c34687174009ad2.poster.avif?t=1651607437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/f809a0bee695688f2c34687174009ad2.webm?t=1651607437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/f809a0bee695688f2c34687174009ad2.mp4?t=1651607437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2022 Collect loot from your vanquished enemies and treasure chests<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/cdfd8bb64126dd2e9b2ab8f05b78e58d.poster.avif?t=1651607437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/cdfd8bb64126dd2e9b2ab8f05b78e58d.webm?t=1651607437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/cdfd8bb64126dd2e9b2ab8f05b78e58d.mp4?t=1651607437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2022 Find Spell Scrolls to learn powerful spells<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/c023709bd64ca19708bf3a3b01053b52.poster.avif?t=1651607437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/c023709bd64ca19708bf3a3b01053b52.webm?t=1651607437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/c023709bd64ca19708bf3a3b01053b52.mp4?t=1651607437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2022 Return to camp between runs to craft new gear and items, cook food, visit the Merchant to trade, and upgrade your character at the Soul Forge<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/b28101cab49cd9d5e069eb4c365f8074.poster.avif?t=1651607437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/b28101cab49cd9d5e069eb4c365f8074.webm?t=1651607437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897860/extras/b28101cab49cd9d5e069eb4c365f8074.mp4?t=1651607437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>\u2022 Immersive, original score",
